OL,3,GNEWSAMore arrests after car damaged by
OL,4,Agunshots
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fcar was hit by gunshots in Swansea.
OL,9,FArmed officers from South Wales Police
OL,10,Fsaid a car on Clase Road, Morriston,
OL,11,Fsustained damage "consistent with a
OL,12,Ffirearms discharge" on Friday at 16:14
OL,13,FGMT. One person suffered minor
OL,14,Finjuries.
OL,16,FA 24-year-old and a 42-year-old have
OL,17,Fbeen arrested.
OL,19,FIt follows the arrests of a 41-year-old
OL,20,Fman and a 16-year-old boy who were
OL,21,Flater released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
